      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUPER LADY (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (18.00) at this track behind Love Shake in a Maiden. Turned chasing the leaders but kept coming. Comes through a solid form race last start. Sure to be about the mark. LUNA'S SHAKE (6) was safely held on debut when seventh (24.64) at Casino over 411m. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. CLOVER PUCA (1) gets a chance to turn around his from the inside. Last time finished 6th on October 2 over 350m at Grafton behind Knight Express beaten 7 lengths (20.78) in a Mix. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. CLASSIC MIX (7) is a chance after six weeks.",
